<title>INDIA: India TELCO to meet May 27 for results.</title>
<headline>India TELCO to meet May 27 for results.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian truck-maker Tata Engineering &amp; Locomotive Company Ltd (TELCO) will meet on May 27 to announce its 1996/97 (April-March) annual results, the firm said in a notice to the Bombay Stock Exchange on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 900</p>
</text>
